# Copy this file to .env for LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY.
#
# WARNING: Create React App bakes REACT_APP_* variables directly into the
# public JavaScript bundle at build time. Anyone who visits your deployed
# site can open dev tools / view-source and read this key in plain text.
# This is fine for testing on your own machine, but do NOT rely on this
# for a real deployment.
#
# For a real deployment: leave this unset and instead let each user enter
# their own key in the app's "Connect AI" settings panel (kept in memory
# only, never bundled or persisted) — or better, add a small backend/
# serverless function that holds the key server-side and proxies the
# Groq request, so the key never reaches the browser at all.

REACT_APP_GROQ_API_KEY=
